---
title: Light Lemon Garlic Pasta with Salmon
description: Get into summer full swing with this light lemon garlic pasta with salmon. Full of fresh, summer flavors!
image: https://thecookingjar.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/light-lemon-garlic-pasta-salmon-1-225x225.jpg
time required: 30 minutes
author: The Cooking Jar
prep time: 10 minutes
source: https://thecookingjar.com/light-lemon-garlic-pasta-with-salmon
nutrition:
  calories: 426 calories
  fat: 9.6 g
  saturated fat: 1.6 g
  carbohydrates: 57.2 g
  sugar: 2.2 g
